<title>FRANCE: GBL buys 1.3pct of Canal+ - paper.</title>
<headline>GBL buys 1.3pct of Canal+ - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Bruxelles Lambert (GBL) acquired a 1.33 percent stake in Canal Plus traded on the Paris bourse on Friday, the newspaper Les Echos said on Monday, quoting GBL director Didier Bellens.</p>
<p>Officials at GBL were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
